el), 24,000+, and 48,000+ pieces."},{"question":"Does this component have a strict moisture sensitivity level (MSL) rating?","answer":"No, this capacitor is rated as MSL 1 (Moisture Sensitivity Level 1). This indicates an unlimited floor life under ambient conditions (≤30°C/85% RH) and means it does not require special dry-bag storage or a pre-assembly baking process prior to standard reflow soldering."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C23630","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1864931","fileName":" 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1624669","fileName":"ROHS认证_贴片电容原材料_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/329ecc8904689d9af5b272ec0ed8e00a.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1750838","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1478399","fileName":"MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"}],"productDescEn":"2.2uF ±10% 16V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","productIntroEn":"2.2uF ±10% 16V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10951_n","paramName":"容值","paramNameEn":"Capacitance","paramValue":"2.2uF","paramValueEn":"2.2uF","paramValueEnForSearch":2200000.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_10927","paramName":"温度系数","paramNameEn":"Temperature Coefficient","paramValue":"X5R","paramValueEn":"X5R","paramValueEnForSearch":-1.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":4},{"paramCode":"param_10923_s","paramName":"精度","paramNameEn":"Tolerance","paramValue":"±10%","paramValueEn":"±10%","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":2},{"paramCode":"param_10924_n","paramNam